userPromptTemplate:
Generate ONLY day {{context.dayNumber}} of {{context.dayCount}} for a trip to {{context.destination}}.{{context.originLine}}
{{context.dateLine}}
{{context.lodgingLine}}
Party: {{context.partyDescription}}. {{context.budgetLine}}
PRICE GUIDANCE: {{context.priceGuidance}}
Preferences: companion {{context.companion}}; pace {{context.pace}}; style {{context.interest}}; accommodation {{context.accommodation}}; {{context.earlyStartsText}}.
WHAT THOSE PREFERENCES MEAN FOR THIS DAY:
- {{context.companionGuidance}}
- {{context.paceGuidance}}
- {{context.interestGuidance}}
{{context.notesLine}}
User-facing summary, day title, stop notes, saved-place notes, packing names and packing categories must be written in {{context.responseLanguage}}. Preserve official place names.

{{context.zoneLine}}
Stops already used on other days or already in this trip: {{context.usedStopNames}}
Do not repeat any of them. Cluster this day geographically and include at least one food stop.
{{context.extrasLine}}
{{context.retryLine}}

MEALS — separate from the stops list. Return 3 to 5 entries in "meals": breakfast, lunch and dinner are all required, plus 0-2 snack/drink entries. Each meal's perPersonCost is a real price for its named venueType, per person, in {{context.pricingCurrencyCode}} — never the same number twice unless two meals genuinely cost the same. If a meal happens at one of this day's stops (e.g. a food stop is where lunch happens), set relatedStopName to that stop's exact name so the two are never double-counted; leave it empty otherwise. A food-category stop's own estimatedCost must be 0 — its price belongs in the matching meal, not on the stop.

RIDES — separate from each stop's legFromPrevious. Return every ride that actually happens this day in "rides", covering the WHOLE day: lodging to the first stop, every ride between stops, AND the last stop back to lodging — not only the gaps legFromPrevious already covers. A walking ride has fare 0. A train/subway/bus fare is per person (isPerPerson true); a taxi/rideshare fare is per vehicle regardless of party size (isPerPerson false). Use real local fares for the named mode — never reuse one fare for the whole day. If this destination has a one-day transit pass that would be cheaper than the summed per-ride fares, set dayPassFare to its real per-person price; otherwise set dayPassFare to 0.

HARD REQUIREMENTS:
- Return exactly one days entry and set dayNumber to {{context.dayNumber}}.
- Every stop must be a real place in {{context.destination}}, with a real address and realistic time, duration, rating and opening hours where known.
- For a stop that charges admission, set estimatedCost to its real per-person price. For a stop that is genuinely free to enter, set isFreeAdmission true and estimatedCost 0. For a stop whose price you do not actually know, set isPriceUnknown true and estimatedCost 0 — never use 0 alone to mean "I don't know".
- Price EVERYTHING in {{context.pricingCurrencyCode}} and set "costCurrencyCode" to {{context.pricingCurrencyCode}}. Never convert to another currency yourself.
- lodgingSuggestion must contain the property name only. Do not include parentheses, star ratings, comfort descriptors or a sentence.
- The first stop must omit legFromPrevious. EVERY stop after the first MUST include legFromPrevious with positive minutes and distanceMeters, plus exactly 2 mode options: the chosen mode and one realistic alternative. Never return a later stop without a leg. (legFromPrevious is for scheduling/arrival-time only — it is separate from the "rides" list above, which is what the Budget tab reads.)
- Keep every note and title to one short sentence. Brevity matters — an answer cut off before the JSON closes is unusable.
- Order stops geographically. startTime is 24-hour HH:mm. category is sight, food, shopping, stay, transport, activity or other.

Return strict JSON only in this shape:
{
  "summary": "String",
  "costCurrencyCode": {{context.pricingCurrencyCode}},
  "lodgingSuggestion": "String",
  "days": [{
    "dayNumber": {{context.dayNumber}}, "title": "String", "stops": [{
      "name": "String", "category": "sight", "startTime": "10:00", "durationMinutes": 90,
      "note": "String", "address": "String", "rating": 4.6, "estimatedCost": 600,
      "isFreeAdmission": false, "isPriceUnknown": false,
      "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "17:00", "lastEntryMinutesBeforeClose": 60,
      "legFromPrevious": {"mode":"transit","minutes":24,"distanceMeters":4100,"cost":280,"transfers":1,"detail":"String","options":[{"mode":"walk","minutes":58,"distanceMeters":4100,"cost":0,"transfers":0,"detail":""}]}
    }],
    "meals": [
      {"kind":"breakfast","venueType":"convenience store","perPersonCost":500,"note":"String","relatedStopName":""},
      {"kind":"lunch","venueType":"ramen counter","perPersonCost":950,"note":"String","relatedStopName":"String"},
      {"kind":"dinner","venueType":"izakaya","perPersonCost":2200,"note":"String","relatedStopName":""}
    ],
    "rides": [
      {"from":"Lodging","to":"First stop name","mode":"transit","fare":250,"isPerPerson":true,"note":"String"},
      {"from":"Last stop name","to":"Lodging","mode":"transit","fare":260,"isPerPerson":true,"note":"String"}
    ],
    "dayPassFare": 0
  }],
  "savedPlaces": [{"name":"String","category":"food","note":"String","estimatedCost":0,"rating":4.4}],
  "packingItems": [{"name":"String","category":"String","needToBuy":false}]
}
